  "post_content": "<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">(32 fotos) Suera ha viscut una vesprada solid&agrave;ria aquest dimarts dins de la XXXIII Setmana Cultural. Al Centre Cultural, organitzador de les jornades, s&#39;ha arreplegat menjar, productes de neteja i higiene personal que despr&eacute;s es lliurararan a Serveis Socials del poble i a l&#39;ONG Quisqueya d&#39;Onda. </span></p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/08/MercadetSegonaMaSetmanaCulturalSuera.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px;\">M&eacute;s tard s&#39;ha fet el II Mercat de venda i intercanvi de tota mena de productes de segona m&agrave;, artesanals o elaborats a casa.</span></p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadet-solidari-suera/img_0691.jpg\" alt=\"img_0691\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadet-solidari-suera/img_0692.jpg\" alt=\"img_0692\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadet-solidari-suera/img_0702.jpg\" alt=\"img_0702\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadet-solidari-suera/img_0707.jpg\" alt=\"img_0707\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadet-solidari-suera/img_0708.jpg\" alt=\"img_0708\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadet-solidari-suera/img_0711.jpg\" alt=\"img_0711\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/mercadet-solidari-suera/img_0716.jpg\" alt=\"img_0716\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439